            <td><strong>UT_Test</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_experimental</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_kernel</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>PreSmoke_A900</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-math/package/3662/slog_910b.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>PreSmoke_ATK_Test_A2</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-math/package/3662/slog_910b.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-30 22:47:40] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:41:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T22:47:41+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177928075,"discussion_id":"e04325ddc87afe5ceed8aad733bf5fde668a2e65","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修改了 `aclnnLogSpaceGetWorkspaceSize` 函数中的数据类型处理逻辑，引入独立的 `compute_dtype` 计算类型概念，替换原先统一使用 `result_dtype` 的做法。主要目的是处理 LogSpace 算子中 `start` 与 `end` 参数在不同数据类型组合下的计算精度与兼容性问题，尤其是针对 INT64 输入、FP16/BF16 混合类型等特殊场景。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **引入 `compute_dtype` 推导逻辑**：通过 `op::PromoteType` 对 `start` 和 `end` 的数据类型进行类型提升推导，若推导失败则返回 `ACLNN_ERR_PARAM_INVALID` 错误，确保输入类型满足提升规则。\n- **INT64 类型回退处理**：当推导出的 `compute_dtype` 为 `DT_INT64` 时，强制转为 `DT_FLOAT`，以兼容 Linspace L0 接口不支持 int64 输入的限制。\n- **FP16/BF16 混合类型升精度**：当 `start` 与 `end` 分别为 `DT_FLOAT16` 和 `DT_BF16`（任意顺序）时，将 `compute_dtype` 升至 `DT_FLOAT`，避免 Linspace 和 Pow 多次 cast 操作带来的精度损失。\n- **ScalarToTensor 统一使用 `compute_dtype`**：原先 `start_tensor`、`end_tensor` 和 `base_tensor` 均以 `result_dtype` 创建，现改为以 `compute_dtype` 创建，确保中间计算在正确的数据类型下进行。\n- **计算完成后按需 Cast 转换**：在 `InplacePow` 之后、`ViewCopy` 之前新增判断，若 `compute_dtype` 与 `result_dtype` 不一致，则通过 `l0op::Cast` 将结果转换为输出类型，保证最终输出与预期类型一致。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:42:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T22:42:38+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177928126,"discussion_id":"4c2ead083eb5ee80d876758d2dc639dde7ad967f","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3912d073cafc4178a19d8792c413f364&pipelineRunId=2834d26b67bf461d8a660be25832e792&projectName=CANN'>2834d26b67bf461d8a660be25832e792</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n   