esource_existence_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_tag_closed_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_markdownlint</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_codestyle</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_c6c9b61dafd14b94ad86d0c4cf44aaaf/f58691f5e29bdea89e885dd206491928?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚠️ WARNING</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3912d073cafc4178a19d8792c413f364&pipelineRunId=2834d26b67bf461d8a660be25832e792&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-math/package/3662/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-30 22:43:35] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:43:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T22:43:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177928846,"discussion_id":"9d3a30683f61dedf626a01bf3f9a56b4c55ab745","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 结束总结\n\n已审查文件：`math/logspace/op_api/aclnn_logspace.cpp`\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0     | 0    |\n| P1     | 0    |\n| P2     | 2    |\n| P3     | 0    |\n\n**发现问题汇总：**\n\n1. **P2 — compute_dtype 为 DT_BOOL 时未转换**：`PromoteType` 对 BOOL+BOOL 输入可能返回 `DT_BOOL`，但 Linspace L0 不支持 BOOL 类型的 start/stop 输入，导致调用失败。旧代码通过始终使用已验证过的 `result_dtype` 规避了此问题，这是一个回归。修复方式：在 DT_INT64→FLOAT 转换处同时增加 DT_BOOL→FLOAT 的处理。\n\n2. **P2 — 缺少对新引入类型推导逻辑的测试覆盖**：diff 引入了 4 个新的分支路径（PromoteType 失败、INT64→FLOAT、FP16/BF16 混合→FLOAT、compute_dtype≠result_dtype 时的 Cast 路径），现有测试均未覆盖。由于这些路径涉及跨芯片平台的行为差异，缺乏测试存在回归风险。\n\n**整体风险判断：** 中低风险。核心类型推导逻辑在常见场景（FLOAT/FLOAT16/BF16 输入）下行为正确，已有的 DT_INT64 和 FP16/BF16 混合处理是正向改进。主要风险在于：1) BOOL 等边界输入类型的回归；2) 缺乏测试覆盖使得新路径的正确性无法在 CI 中验证。建议在合入前补充上述修复和测试。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 0 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 1 |\n\n\uD83D\uDCAC 仅评论\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:50:55+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T22:50:55+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177928848,"discussion_id":"77cea858cbf8d8a597c2b807ba330e044348da53","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n该 diff 引入了关键的 compute_dtype 推导逻辑，包含以下新增分支路径：\n1. `PromoteType` 返回 `DT_UNDEFINED` 的错误路径（line 94-96）\n2. `compute_dtype == DT_INT64` → `DT_FLOAT` 转换路径（line 99-101）\n3. FP16/BF16 混合类型 → `DT_FLOAT` 升级路径（line 102-105）\n4. `compute_dtype != result_dtype` 时的 Cast 路径（line 126-129）\n\n现有测试文件 `test_aclnn_logspace.cpp` 仅有 FLOAT/FLOAT16/BF16 输入的基本用例，没有覆盖以上任何新路径。具体缺失的测试场景包括：\n- start/end 类型组合导致 `PromoteType` 返回 `DT_UNDEFINED` 的异常用例\n\n这些路径涉及跨平台行为差异（Linspace L0 在不同芯片架构上支持的类型不同），缺乏测试覆盖存在回归风险。\n\n**建议**：建议在 `test_aclnn_logspace.cpp` 中增加以下测试用例：1) INT64 start+end 输入（验证自动转为 FLOAT 计算且结果正确）；2) FP16 start + BF16 end 混合输入（验证自动升精度为 FLOAT 且精度符合预期）；3) INT32 start+end + FLOAT 输出（验证 compute_dtype ≠ result_dtype 时的 Cast 路径）；4) 不兼容类型组合导致 DT_UNDEFINED 的异常用例。","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:50:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T11:49:06+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848ca2c48edb4f2f1fed32","login":"sunchun","object_id":"68848ca2c48edb4f2f1fed32","name":"sunchun","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/sunchun"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":127,"end_new_line":127,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":177990881,"discussion_id":"71bb2eae20789a10efd5cf9ec9448ab4ba9985ee","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request has been changed(code update) or closed, so removes the following label(s): ci-pipeline-passed.","created_at":"2026-07-01T11:40:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T11:40:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177993301,"discussion_id":"6917a6192ec678dcbeb310a4e88ae1827ebd0ca9","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-01T11:48:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T11:48:41+08:00","user":{"id":"68848ca2c48edb4f2f1fed32","login":"sunchun","object_id":"68848ca2c48edb4f2f1fed32","n